      "bio_summary": {
        "value": "Joseph David Courtney [ 1 ] (born April 6, 1953) [ 2 ] is an American lawyer and politician serving as the U.S. representative for Connecticut's 2nd congressional district since 2007. His district encompasses most of the eastern third of the state, including Norwich and New London . A member of the Democratic Party , Courtney served as the Connecticut state representative for the 56th district from 1987 to 1995 and Vernon town attorney from 2003 until 2006. ",
